   2:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @file    stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c
   4:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @brief   Extended FLASH HAL module driver.
   6:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          functionalities of the FLASH extension peripheral:
   8:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *           + Extended programming operations functions
   9:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *  
  10:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   @verbatim
  11:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  12:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                    ##### Flash Extension features #####
  13:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            
  15:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] Comparing to other previous devices, the FLASH interface for STM32F76xx/STM32F77xx 
  16:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        devices contains the following additional features 
  17:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        
  18:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Capacity up to 2 Mbyte with dual bank architecture supporting read-while-write
  19:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            capability (RWW)
  20:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Dual bank memory organization       
  21:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Dual boot mode
  22:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****    
  23:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
  24:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  25:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure and program the FLASH memory 
  26:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        of all STM32F7xx devices. It includes
  27:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory Erase functions: 
  28:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and 
  29:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
  30:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Erase function: Erase sector, erase all sectors
  31:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) There are two modes of erase :
  32:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Polling Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase()
  33:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Interrupt Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase_IT()
  34:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              
  35:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Option Bytes Programming functions: Use HAL_FLASHEx_OBProgram() to :
  36:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set/Reset the write protection
  37:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set the Read protection Level
  38:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set the BOR level
  39:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Program the user Option Bytes
  40:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   
  41:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   @endverbatim
  42:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
