 650:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h **** /**
 651:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Get Process Stack Pointer Limit
 652:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   Devices without ARMv8-M Main Extensions (i.e. Cortex-M23) lack the non-secure
 653:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   Stack Pointer Limit register hence zero is returned always in non-secure
 654:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   mode.
 655:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   
