 800:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *              or a value between OB_WRP_SECTOR_0 and OB_WRP_SECTOR_11 (in Single Bank mode for S
 801:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *              or a value between OB_WRP_DB_SECTOR_0 and OB_WRP_DB_SECTOR_23 (in Dual Bank mode f
